WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.493
Tom Kitten was playing outside.

2
00:00:09.494 --> 00:00:13.335
"Time to clean up!" his mother called.

3
00:00:13.336 --> 00:00:22.111
"My friends are coming for tea later."

4
00:00:22.112 --> 00:00:27.747
Mrs. Twitchit washed Mittens' face.

5
00:00:27.748 --> 00:00:37.267
She brushed Moppet's fur.

6
00:00:37.268 --> 00:00:47.248
Then Mrs. Twitchit frowned.

7
00:00:47.249 --> 00:00:50.582
"Tom!" Mrs. Twitchit cried.

8
00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:58.701
"Come inside right now!"

9
00:00:58.702 --> 00:01:04.235
Mittens and Moppet put on pink dresses.

10
00:01:04.236 --> 00:01:10.376
Tom wore a clean shirt and new pants.

11
00:01:10.377 --> 00:01:15.657
Mrs. Twitchit looked around the room.

12
00:01:15.658 --> 00:01:21.658
"I need some pretty flowers," she said.

13
00:01:21.659 --> 00:01:24.742
Tom dashed outside.

14
00:01:24.743 --> 00:01:28.297
"I'll get some flowers!" he said.

15
00:01:28.298 --> 00:01:34.399
Mrs. Twitchit sighed.

16
00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:39.749
"Don't get dirty!" she said.

17
00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:44.337
Tom ran toward the pond.

18
00:01:44.338 --> 00:01:49.990
He didn't see any pretty flowers.

19
00:01:49.991 --> 00:01:54.551
But a frog sat on a boat.

20
00:01:54.570 --> 00:01:58.607
"I'm Jeremy Fisher," the frog said.

21
00:01:58.608 --> 00:02:02.762
"Can you help me find flowers?" Tom asked.

22
00:02:02.763 --> 00:02:05.726
"Yes," Jeremy said.

23
00:02:05.727 --> 00:02:08.532
"Can you help me find fish?"

24
00:02:08.533 --> 00:02:12.002
Tom looked down at his clean clothes.

25
00:02:12.003 --> 00:02:16.437
"I must not get wet," he thought.

26
00:02:16.438 --> 00:02:25.187
"But Mother needs flowers."

27
00:02:25.188 --> 00:02:31.336
Tom stepped into Jeremy's boat.

28
00:02:31.337 --> 00:02:35.242
Drip, drop.

29
00:02:35.243 --> 00:02:41.789
Suddenly it started to rain.

